cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AlphaSDM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaSDM: Species Distribution Models on AlphaEarth Satellite Embeddings"
abstract: >-
  An R package for species distribution modeling at up to 10 m resolution using
  the embeddings of AlphaEarth, Google DeepMind's geospatial foundation model. Data sampling, model training and
  spatial prediction all run server-side on Google Earth Engine.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: James
    family-names: Longo
    email: james.longo.birds@gmail.com
    affiliation: University of Maine
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/James-Longo/AlphaSDM"
url: "https://james-longo.github.io/AlphaSDM/"
keywords:
  - species distribution modeling
  - google earth engine
  - satellite embeddings
  - foundation models
  - habitat suitability
  - remote sensing
  - ecology
